Cell["\<\
Encodes the interaction-net annihilation law: two matching nodes meeting \
head-on disappear, joining their remaining legs pairwise.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"61e061dc-ac8a-4722-9f57-551d413763c9"],

Cell["The following options can be given:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"0edf9989-69ac-4c72-ab91-534e21c9acf3"],

